    "parse frame order, choices, labels, jumps and failure paths without application-specific exclusions",
    "enrich metadata with source and confidence; align translation without replacing Japanese source",
    "validate counts, references, source preservation and download completeness",
    "draft-first immutable data release with checksums and revisions",
    "build KB collection as a downstream artifact; activate through KB release protocol"
